# Per-Dockerfile ignore for tenebris-rs/Dockerfile (BuildKit prefers
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over <context>/.dockerignore). The build
# context is tenebris-rs/; whitelist only what the build copies so the
# local cargo target/ and texture assets never get shipped to the
# builder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!assets/config

# Belt and braces: never let local build output inside crates/ ride
# along even if one appears there.
crates/**/target
